Skewer - blade technique
------------------------------------------------------------
Using the skewer blade technique, a swashbuckler can
concentrate on deep, powerful strikes that cause much 
greater damage to the enemy. This skill is aided by the
ability to discern an enemy's weaknesses and the dexterity
to attack with precision and speed. Such a powerful attack
often off-balances a swashbuckler however, making it
difficult to dodge attacks against himself.

GL: 10
SP:  9 / attack
command:  skewer
duration: technique mode
